Package: cybroid-plymouth-theme
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CybroidOS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://cybroid.com/cybroidos
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: plymouth
Replaces: citos-plymouth-theme (<< 0.1.2~)
Breaks: citos-plymouth-theme (<< 0.1.2~)
Description: CybroidOS boot splash
 Plymouth theme that plays the CybroidOS logo's draw-in animation on the brand
 background, then holds the logo until the next program draws. Installing
 it makes it the default theme and rebuilds the initramfs.
